---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
import CtaBand from '../components/CtaBand.astro';

const values = [
  { t: 'Focus over noise', b: 'We help you do fewer things, better. The goal is impact, not a longer to-do list.' },
  { t: 'Honesty over hype', b: 'Clear scope, real numbers, and no invented results. We would rather lose a deal than oversell one.' },
  { t: 'Execution, not just advice', b: 'We stay for the hard part. A plan only matters when it ships and starts to move the numbers.' },
  { t: 'Partnership for the long run', b: 'We build for the relationship, so the business gets stronger the longer we work together.' },
];
---
<Base
  title="About Voxylis Growth | Growth Consulting for US & UK Businesses"
  description="Voxylis Growth is a growth consulting firm helping US and UK businesses turn ambition into a clear plan and measurable results, with focus, honesty, and hands-on execution."
>
  <section>
    <div class="wrap">
      <div class="sec-head reveal">
        <span class="eyebrow" style="display:block;margin-bottom:0.8rem">About</span>
        <h1 style="font-size:clamp(2rem,4.5vw,3rem)">A growth partner, not just a plan.</h1>
        <p>Voxylis Growth was created around a simple idea: most businesses do not need more things to do. They need focus, a clear plan, and a partner who helps them actually execute it.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="band">
    <div class="wrap">
      <div class="prose reveal">
        <h2>Why we exist.</h2>
        <p>Too many growth efforts stall in the same way. There is energy, there are ideas, and there is a long list of tactics, but no clear sense of which few moves will actually matter, and no one holding the plan together once the week gets busy.</p>
        <p>We work as an outside partner who brings that focus. We dig into where growth is really stuck, build a prioritized plan around the moves that count, and then stay alongside your team to put it in motion and measure what works. When the strategy and the execution finally line up, growth stops feeling like guesswork.</p>
        <p><strong>We keep our claims honest.</strong> We do not invent client logos, testimonials, certifications, or results, and we do not promise revenue figures no consultant can guarantee. We agree on real goals and let the work speak over time.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section>
    <div class="wrap">
      <div class="founder-grid">
        <div class="founder-photo reveal">
          <img src="/img/belle.webp" width="900" height="1200" alt="Belle Dunn, founder of Voxylis Growth" loading="lazy" />
        </div>
        <div class="prose reveal">
          <span class="eyebrow">Our Founder</span>
          <h2 style="margin-top:0.6rem">Meet Belle Dunn.</h2>
          <p class="founder-name">Belle Dunn<span>Founder</span></p>
          <p>Based in Chicago, Belle brings more than eight years across operations, customer experience, sales support, and technology-driven solutions. She has worked side by side with business owners and teams to keep operations organized, responsive, and moving forward, and she runs several businesses of her own.</p>
          <p>That hands-on experience shaped how she approaches growth. It is rarely about one clever tactic. It is about understanding the whole business, choosing the few priorities that matter, building the systems to support them, and staying close enough to adjust as the real numbers come in.</p>
          <p><strong>That belief is the foundation of Voxylis Growth</strong>, a consulting partner built to help growing US and UK businesses move with focus and see real, measurable progress.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="band">
    <div class="wrap">
      <div class="sec-head reveal"><span class="eyebrow" style="display:block;margin-bottom:0.8rem">What We Value</span><h2>Principles behind every engagement.</h2></div>
      <div class="grid cols-2" style="margin-top:2.4rem">
        {values.map((v) => (
          <div class="card reveal">
            <h3 style="font-size:1.2rem">{v.t}</h3>
            <p class="muted" style="margin-top:0.5rem;font-size:0.96rem">{v.b}</p>
          </div>
        ))}
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <CtaBand heading="Let's build something that actually grows." cta="Book a Consultation" />
</Base>
